NAME
       whoami - print the effective user name

SYNOPSIS
       whoami

DESCRIPTION
       Print the name of the effective user, from /etc/passwd

NOTES
       UC.OS has no /etc/passwd by default, so whoami fails,
       as GNU whoami does without a user entry.

SEE ALSO
       sh(1)

